{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t立法會交通事務委員會討論4間巴士公司申請加價，多名議員批評加幅過高。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n運輸及物流局說，審批時會考慮市民整體負擔能力，絕對不會對加幅照單全收。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T12:00:30.459748+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:40:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T17:17:56.286014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:58:04.676731+00:00","content_hash":"3d64a1da7593f11c0aa670219f00374f4afebb857d3b5eb358158548db98d780","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}